{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 28, :comments ["<b>And after the death of the high priest the manslayer shall return</b> etc. — for the cities of refuge of the Levites are under the authority of the high priest, and this one entered under his authority in his city; it is fitting justice that he go free upon his death. And our Sages said: his death atones. And a parallel to this we find: אסיריו לא פתח ביתה."], :book :numbers, :voice :chizkuni, :lang :en, :chapter 35, :notes {0 "The last phrase cites Judges 15:1 in abbreviated form; rendered hyper-literally as the Hebrew stands, without resolving the citation into fluent English."}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T15:20:46.219379270Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}